<title>SWEDEN: ELECTROLUX Q1 PROFIT FALLS 14 PCT.</title>
<headline>ELECTROLUX Q1 PROFIT FALLS 14 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish appliance maker</p>
<p>Electrolux on Tuesday presented earnings for the three months</p>
<p>to March 31, 1997,</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		  777   vs     901</p>
<p> Sales				    28,715   vs  27,582</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			    694   vs     797</p>
<p> Shr (crowns)				5.70  vs    6.90</p>
</text>
